-ws1506954"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017","text":"省內與直閣將軍卜伯興謀其夜共攻齊王會秉去事覺齊王夜使驍騎將軍王敬則收韞韞已戒嚴敬則率壯士直前韞左右皆披靡因殺之伯興亦伏誅粲敗秉踰城出走於額檐湖見擒與二子承俁並死秉時年四十五秉妻蕭氏思話女也元徽中朝廷危殆妻常懼禍敗每謂秉曰君富貴已足故應為兒子作計年垂五十殘生何足恡邪秉不能從秉弟謨奉朝請謨弟遐字彥道亦奉朝請員外散騎侍郎與嫡母殷養女雲敷私通殷每禁之殷暴病卒未及殮口鼻流血疑遐潛加毒害為有司所糾世祖徙之始安郡永光中得還太宗世歷","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"秉","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABDB","confidence":"high","source_role_key":"liuyu-rekey:bing"},{"id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi:p017:m0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"俁","kind":"person","person_id":"3qs_nqa_ioa_AABDBB","confidence":"high","source_role_key":"liuyu-rekey:liuyu"}],"source_position":{"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/song051-wyd1739-zongshi/transcription-projection.json","raw_file_sha256":"aa7b16d610871f77b747adbe0edb84f8775e1d404140a1e3f6284dccd11aaa45","unit_key":"unit017","source_layer":"received_chapter","first_line":157,"last_line":166},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi","book_id":"b-songshu-051","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-051-wyd1739-zongshi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-015","source_id":"s-liangshu015-ws1506954","source":{"title":"《梁書》卷十五謝朏完整本傳（含子諼、篹附傳）","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=梁書/卷15&oldid=1506954","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=梁書/卷15&oldid=1506954","revision_id":1506954,"accessed_on":"2026-10-21","extent":"原11至27行九完整段共1953原字，止29行謝覽獨立傳之前；非全卷，不匯入篇末姚察史論及現代校注。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄，保留數位歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫數位轉錄，未核底本影像","response_sha256":"73a047d0a44ea0cf7fa9c04fbd63cf0568cd6d1a3616dcf2ac64936942dea064","wikitext_sha256":"0ae55481ce12880db956ce367fee817fd1cd64f07685408996c5f31f080